backend/data/

# Large data / temp files (would exceed GitHub's 100MB file limit)
*.zip
*.csv
*.xlsx
*.xls
response.txt

# Exception: price tier mapping needed by Toast Pricing Export
!Toast Price Tiers Mapping .xlsx
!backend/price_tier_mapping.csv

# Exception: Toast→Aloha mapping table (source of truth for menu performance YoY)
!Updated Mapping Table.xlsx

# Exception: canonical Aloha items list (drives the Mapping Table UI dropdown
# via backend/import_aloha_items.py → aloha_items_master)
!Items by Category.xlsx

# Exception: PLU range source file (loaded into plu_ranges via import_plu_ranges.py)
!backend/Item PLU Ranges.xlsx

# Exception: per-store Aloha→Toast switchover dates (loaded into
# toast_switchover_dates via import_switchover_dates.py)
!backend/Toast Switchover Dates.xlsx

# Exception: comp store list (Daily Sales Flash Report's "comp" group)
# served by /api/locations/comping for the location-picker "All Comping" filter
!backend/comp_stores.json

# Exception: location config files (not DBs, safe to track)
!backend/data/aloha/aloha_location_mapping.json
!backend/data/fbc_location_mapping.json
!backend/data/fbc_store_mapping.json

